  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_04",
  "title": "他是将军",
  "storyCode": "OF-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4cd92d443d50eb81126a638a10a8f28086184b550a801f8c2fa9b9e5a8380802",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "A队，B队，远处盯紧了。C队，从后面包围。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "佣兵团的风格吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "有几分实力，训练的人有些水准，不过，还不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这，这个老头好强！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "不在一个等级上。你们在旁边守好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（这个女人......不简单。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（这些保镖虽然伤不到我，但她能够对我造成威胁。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "愚蠢的外地人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（她很愤怒。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（站在她的立场上，或许真的是认为我们蒙骗了锡兰小姐。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（但是，有哪里不对。这个人到底是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "不愧是经验丰富的佣兵，即使你家小姐被带走也没有乱了阵脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说什么废话！既然你知道我们头曾经是......咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（......嗯？等等......弩，菲林，这个名字。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（我在哪里听说过这个名字......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，这老头要干什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（虽然有些担忧博士那边的情况。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（......不过以博士的能力，加之汐斯塔市内还有其他人在，应当问题不大。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他往我们这边冲了，他疯了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快，快拦住他！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "太慢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
